     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">See the itemfit() function, e.g., <div><br></div><div>###########</div><div>library(mirt)</div><div>dat &lt;- key2binary(SAT12,<br>                   key = c(1,4,5,2,3,1,2,1,3,1,2,4,2,1,5,3,4,4,1,4,3,3,4,1,3,5,1,3,1,5,4,5))<br>mod &lt;- mirt(dat, 1)<br>itemfit(mod, empirical.plot = 1)</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
