     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">Em sáb, 19 de out de 2019 às 21:27, Phil Chalmers &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rphilip....@gmail.com</a>&gt; escreveu:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">See the itemfit() function, e.g., <div><br></div><div>###########</div><div>library(mirt)</div><div>dat &lt;- key2binary(SAT12,<br>                   key = c(1,4,5,2,3,1,2,1,3,1,2,4,2,1,5,3,4,4,1,4,3,3,4,1,3,5,1,3,1,5,4,5))<br>mod &lt;- mirt(dat, 1)<br>itemfit(mod, empirical.plot = 1)</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sat, Oct 19, 2019 at 3:25 PM Hugo Harada &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hugo....@adaptativa.com.br</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hello all,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Is there an easy way to get plotted in the same graph the estimated curves and the observed frequencies like one can get with BILOG-MG? </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">It seems that itemplot() does not handle that. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">empirical_plot() get close but only with number of correct scores ..<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Looking forward to hearing from you,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hugo</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/mirt-package/attach/a59a2883896e1/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"375\" style=\"margin-right:25px\"><br></div></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472572681000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3czc7YJGSdHd2tJUabI5zc\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk3Ee8Wg4ibOcS9FfxhtyTI=s0-d-e1-ft#https://htmlsigs.s3.amazonaws.com/logos/files/000/177/391/landscape/adaptativa_256px80pxL_72dpi_SEM_SLOGAN.jpg\" alt=\"Adaptativa\" border=\"0\" height=\"62\" width=\"200\"></a></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:14px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline\">Hugo Harada</span><span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span>Sócio-fundador - COO</font><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><span style=\"font-we